{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>All</b> — The sense of <b>at Gilgal</b>: it is the place where they were when they crossed the Jordan. It was fitting that they should remember My kindness, since their fathers were there — I brought them to My land, and now I will drive them from My house."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:42.946352916Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}